The '''Mar al-Wasat Bridge''' ({{Langx|mxi|بُوِينْتِي دِيلْ مَارْ اَلْوَاسَتْ|Pwénte del Mar al-Wasat|Bridge of the Middle Sea}}; {{langx|bl|Ponte Mar Interior|4=Interior Sea Bridge}}) is a {{convert|2.63|km||0|abbr=on}} long combined [[W:List of road–rail bridges|railway and motorway]] [[W:Suspension bridge|suspension bridge]] spanning the [[Mar al-Wasat]] (Mar Interior) to connect the [[Algarves|Algarvean]] [[Cantons of Balisca|islands]] of [[Nueva Mayurqa]] on the northern shore and [[Ceclavín]] on the southern shore.

